<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87965" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προ-μᾰλάσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρό-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>soften beforehand, make supple by rubbing</i>
			or <i>kneading,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				869b30
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.90
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.287
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόπολις -ομένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					<u>Eup.</u>
					1.208
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>relax first,</i> in 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προμαλαχθέντων τῶν σπλάγχνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.Trall.
					10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ θυμούμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.579
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προμαλαττόμενον τὸν δῆμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Caes.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ -μαλαχθέντα τῇ ἑρμηνείᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermog.
					<u>Meth.</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			.</div>
